WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.433
This morning.

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:00.734
The death

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.435
toll is rising in eastern Ukraine

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.337
after a barrage of new Russian

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:05.105
missile strikes.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:05.972
Ukrainian officials say

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.474
at least two people were killed.

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.576
Dozens more injured in Sloviansk

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.211
several high rise

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.812
buildings, civilian buildings

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:13.480
that were targeted

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.582
were reduced to rubble and ashes.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.183
Explosions also rocking

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.986
the Russian occupied city of Melita Paul.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.154
This dash cam video

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.523
capturing the billowing smoke.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.558
These strikes came less than 24 hours

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.159
after Vladimir

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.261
Putin announced plans to move

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.730
and station tactical nuclear weapons

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.033
like the ones in this missile.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.769
Here we're showing you in Belarus,

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:38.038
Putin says he wants to store them

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.039
there, buy summer,

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.273
which means they could be

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.142
closer to Ukraine,

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:43.710
but also to NATO's borders.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.278
With me now is the Belarusian

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.313
political activist and opposition leader,

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.116
Ana Tic a.k.a.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.218
Nice to have you on again. Good morning.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:52.485
First,

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.820
I want to ask you about Putin's

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.287
threat here

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:56.823
to move nuclear weapons to Belarus.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:00.326
Does this in your view amount to Russia

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.295
threatening Ukraine

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.363
with a nuclear attack,

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:08.268
facilities aiming to subjugate Belarus

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:11.771
and it violates our constitution.

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:15.408
It violates international security.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.211
And of course, it's against those

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:19.379
people's will.

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.815
We are non-nuclear country,

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:25.585
and we don't want to deploy

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:27.020
anybody, deploy

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.222
a nuclear weapon in our state.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.291
He's made nuclear threats before,

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.926
as have other Russian

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.861
officials, including

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.896
former president as well, Medvedev.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.700
Are these just threats or do you believe

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.269
he may actually use such weapons?

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.040
I think the dictators in this difficult

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.477
situation for them can make crazy steps.

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:53.513
But I think the democratic world

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.615
has to show that

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.617
it will not be tolerated.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.886
And the strong steps must be made

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.188
in order to stop this.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.559
The steps from from fulfilling

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:08.928
as you know, Putin has at times

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.363
pressured the Belarussian

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.533
President, Lukashenko, to supply forces

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.401
and wealth weapons to help

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:17.770
in his invasion. Of Ukraine.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:18.972
It hasn't happened yet.

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.040
Do you believe it may happen now

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.609
as the Russian

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:23.676
president makes plans to move

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.811
nuclear weapons there?

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.613
So actually, it's a wrong perception.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.381
That Putin pushes

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.150
Lukashenka to do something.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.352
They are on the one side of this war.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:34.020
They call up runs.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:34.787
Lukashenko became

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.156
fully complicit in this war

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.858
and he fulfills all the orders of Putin.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:39.926
The fact

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.060
that the Russian troops

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.729
haven't been sent to

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:44.564
Belarus is not the merit of Lukashenko.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.398
It's merit of builders

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:47.567
and people who are against

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.435
participation of builders in this war.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:52.472
And our soldiers don't have anti

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:53.606
Ukrainian moods.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:54.774
They don't want to kill

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.576
or to be killed on the battlefields.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:59.145
For the ambitions of observers.

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:01.447
And Lukashenka

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.750
is responsible for crimes

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.518
of aggression against Ukraine.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.587
And he has to be called

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:09.122
a sponsor

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:09.789
of terrorism,

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.357
and they have to be

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.726
brought to accountability for this.

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:15.495
You I should remind people watching,

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:16.529
they may not be aware, but.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.497
But you ran against

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:18.765
Lukashenko for president.

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:19.899
You say the election

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.634
was stolen from you, from you,

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.469
and since then you paid a price.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:25.371
Your husband is still held

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:26.239
in a Russian prison

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:27.640
more than two years now.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.374
Do you feel that

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.176
the world is overlooking

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:32.779
Russia's aggression in Belarus?

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:33.112
Of course

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:34.113
there's a war in Ukraine,

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:35.081
but that Belarus is not

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:37.517
getting the attention it deserves.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:39.919
I think that at the moment Belarus is

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:41.287
actually overlooked

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.121
and maybe not all

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.690
the politicians understand

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.391
the rule of Belarus.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.560
In regional peace and security.

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:49.862
And I really want the U.S.

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.164
President Biden

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:52.131
and State Department

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:55.735
to look more deeply into this problem

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:57.437
and not to leave Belarus

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:58.871
for one day later,

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.673
you know, after we'll deal with Ukraine,

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:02.842
and then we will return to Belarus.

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:04.811
We don't have to forget that person

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:07.213
people now are fighting not only against

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:09.048
Lukashenko's regime,

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:10.450
but also against hybrid

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.152
occupation of Russia.

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:13.853
In Belarus,

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:16.389
we see the increasing level

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.591
of violence, repressions.

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:20.793
Thousands of people are in prisons

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:22.528
for politically motivated cases.

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:24.364
Hundreds of thousands had to flee Belarus

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:26.332
because of repression.

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:29.068
And one day we can wake up

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:30.303
and see that Beatrice has lived

00:04:30.303 --> 00:04:32.171
as a consolation prize for Putin.

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:35.575
And I'm sure that Belarus is a key state

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:39.345
for keeping security in Europe.

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.546
You're in Washington

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:41.814
this week to meet with U.S.

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:43.082
officials in part.

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:43.483
Is the U.S.

00:04:43.483 --> 00:04:45.251
doing enough for Belarus, in your view?

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:47.220
In all

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.523
the nations who are going through

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:52.292
violations of their rights,

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:55.028
who are in difficult position

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:57.964
assure that much more could be done.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:01.701
You know, and we are grateful to the U.S.

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:03.569
for all the

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:04.570
excellent solidarity

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.673
and support to our people.

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:08.775
But I think that

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:11.010
more pressure can be imposed on

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:15.181
the Russian Belarusian regime

00:05:15.448 --> 00:05:16.716
and more support

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:19.352
can be provided to those people who are

00:05:20.887 --> 00:05:22.488
who are resisting.

00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:24.090
Now, to all this.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.392
And also, we are calling now

00:05:26.426 --> 00:05:27.560
an international community

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.629
to bring Lukashenko to accountability

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:31.698
through possible mechanisms like ICC.

00:05:31.698 --> 00:05:33.366
You can start investigation

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:34.167
of his crimes

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:35.034
against humanity

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:37.103
and crimes of aggression.

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:39.005
But several steps

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:41.641
have been made to recently by the U.S.

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:45.111
just to a new package of sanctions and

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:48.981
a launch of strategic

00:05:48.981 --> 00:05:50.249
dialog with democratic

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:52.318
Belarus was started.

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:53.853
And we are proceed this step.

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:55.488
Also, special envoy

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:58.191
will be sent to democratic forces

00:05:58.191 --> 00:05:59.225
to Lithuania

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:01.427
to make to build this bridges

00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:03.162
between our countries.

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:04.831
I want to ask you about your husband.

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:06.532
He's serving an 18 year

00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:08.034
prison sentence simply

00:06:08.034 --> 00:06:09.602
for challenging Lukashenko.

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:11.137
You have not been able to speak to him

00:06:11.137 --> 00:06:13.373
for I believe, more than two years now.

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:15.608
Do you have any idea

00:06:15.608 --> 00:06:17.844
what his state of health is

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:20.646
and what his prospects are for release.

00:06:20.646 --> 00:06:23.549
So all our political prisoners, including

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:25.818
my husband, are ill treated,

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:26.919
humiliated physically

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:28.354
and morally in prisons.

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:31.090
So they are in extremely poor position

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:33.826
there, but they're keeping strong.

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:35.561
They know that

00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:36.662
the Russian society

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:37.897
and the international world

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.932
are fighting for them.

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.534
You know, they believe in us.

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:43.870
They believe in international laws

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.805
and in solidarity.

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:47.140
And I think that

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.942
we can betrayed them.

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:50.643
We have

00:06:50.643 --> 00:06:51.244
to release

00:06:51.244 --> 00:06:52.879
all of our political prisoners

00:06:52.879 --> 00:06:55.715
and get rid of this regime in Belarus.

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:57.016
Well, we wish you the best luck

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:59.385
and we hope your family is reunited soon.

